// The icon Windows shows for stacktrace.exe: in File Explorer, on the taskbar
// and in the title bar. Built by windres (part of w64devkit) in the makefile.
// raylib's window library (GLFW) looks for an icon called GLFW_ICON in the
// .exe and uses it for the window from the moment it's made, so the taskbar
// never shows the default icon.
GLFW_ICON ICON "logo.ico"
